      {
        "text": "The then president of the Southern Baptist Convention spoke during my chairmanship.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "There was a cyclical pattern of migration—people would come and return.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Two signs were posted at the southern border: 'No Trespassing' and 'Help Wanted'.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
